The SLC611-Z is a device with wattage (W) and kilowatt hours (kWh) measurement functions. It allows you to control On/Off status and to check real-time energy usage via mobile App.

## Key Features

- ZigBee 3.0
- Single phase electricity compatible
- Measure the instantaneous and accumulative energy usage of the connected devices
- Measures real-time Voltage, Current, PowerFactor, Active Power
- Support Energy Usage/Production measurement
- Support Switch input terminal
- Schedule the device to automatically power electronics on and off
- 10A Dry contact output
- Lightweight and easy to install
- Extend the range and strengthen ZigBee network communication
- Power-on status setting
